# Wave W17-O (Ragged Pass): spring post — a spring-terrace marker post on the stair’s lower steps: a sturdy post with a white steam-band painted round its head and a spring-blue droplet bead under it, marking where Steamspring’s water first shows above the steps (design: steam wisps rising from Steamspring at the stair’s foot). On stair turf (fully opaque, ground baked in) — split from the route marker posts by the steam band and the droplet: this post marks water, not distance.
